            ^"Heart’s Desire" STRING "To rule over magi. Initially, to lead Jardin as First Magus, eventually to become a Tribunal Praeco and then Bjornaer Prima."
            ^"Reputations" STRING "Animalistic 1 (5) (magi) Combat: Dodge: Init +1, Attack n/a, Defense +7, Damage n/a Fist: Init: +1, Attack +7, Defense +6, Damage +3 Kick: Init: +0, Attack +7, Defense +5, Damage +6"
